      "cause": "`b.rating - a.rating || a.title > b.title ? 1 : -1` parses as `(b.rating - a.rating || a.title > b.title) ? 1 : -1`. It only ever returns ±1 and ignores which way the ratings differ.",
      "fix": "`(a, b) => b.rating - a.rating || a.title.localeCompare(b.title)`",
