@@@ repo/README.md
# movie-db

`memdb` supports Mongo-style filters: `{ field: { $regex, $options } }`, `$gt`, `$gte`, `$lt`, `$lte`, `$in`, `$ne`.
Seed data lives in `src/data/movies.js`.
